## Implementation Details

According to the official Vercel documentation, for React applications using Vite, the recommended approach is to:
1. Install `@vercel/analytics` package ✓
2. Import `Analytics` from `@vercel/analytics/react` ✓
3. Add the `<Analytics />` component to the app ✓

All three steps have been completed correctly in this project.

## Next Steps for Deployment

To enable analytics data collection, you need to:
1. Deploy this project to Vercel (if not already deployed)
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard for your project
3. After deployment, analytics will automatically start tracking page views and web vitals

The code implementation is complete and ready for production use.

